OL,3,GNEWSAMan who killed parents and brother
OL,4,Afound guilty of manslaughter
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 32-year-old man who killed his
OL,7,Fparents and younger brother has been
OL,8,Ffound not guilty of their murders but
OL,9,Fguilty of manslaughter by diminished
OL,10,Fresponsibility.
OL,12,FThe jury at the Central Criminal Court
OL,13,Fin Dublin accepted evidence given by
OL,14,Ftwo psychiatrists that Robert O'Connor
OL,15,Fwas suffering from a relapse of
OL,16,Fschizophrenia when he stabbed the three
OL,17,Fmembers of his family to death in
OL,18,FSeptember 2025.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
