OL,3,GNEWSAMan who killed parents and brother
OL,4,Afound guilty of manslaughter
OL,5,
OL,6,FLouise O'Connor, 56, her 54-year-old
OL,7,Fhusband Mark O'Connor, and their son
OL,8,FEvan, 27, were found dead at their home
OL,9,Fin Drumgowna, County Louth.
OL,11,FLawyers for Robert O'Connor had asked
OL,12,Fjurors to consider finding him not
OL,13,Fguilty by reason of insanity so that he
OL,14,Fcould get the "proper mental health
OL,15,Ftreatment".
